'''Grim Reaper''' is a {{Mythic}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up during, one hour before, and one hour after the [[Spooky Festival]].

== Spawning ==
'''Grim Reaper''' can be fished up from water one hour before, during, and after the [[Spooky Festival]], while the {{NPCSprite|Fear Mongerer}} is in the {{zone|Village}}. It requires {{Skill|fishing|26}} or higher to be fished up.

[[Sea Creatures#Spooky|Spooky Sea Creatures]] have a {{Green|15%}} base chance to override other Sea Creature spawns. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:

